# Production Code Artisan - .cursorrules
# Enforce senior-architect standards on every AI generation
1. ZERO SLOP: Complete every function fully. Never emit "// TODO: implement later" or dummy mocks.
2. OWASP SECURITY: Parameterize all SQL/NoSQL queries. Never interpolate variables into queries or commands.
3. SECRETS: Never hardcode API keys, passwords, or tokens. Validate process.env at startup.
4. PERFORMANCE: Never query databases inside iterative loops (prevent N+1). Use batched Promise.all / IN queries.
5. OBSERVABILITY: Catch errors as unknown, narrow type, log with context, and never swallow errors silently.
6. STRICT TYPES: No "any" in TypeScript. Use generics, runtime Zod schemas, and exhaustive checks.
7. MULTILINGUAL & RTL: Use CSS logical properties (padding-inline, margin-inline) and isolate numbers/LTR tokens with <bdi> in Arabic.
